.TH HOMELAB-API-BACKEND-PROCESSOR 8 "2026-07-31" "homelab-api-backend-processor" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
homelab-api-backend-processor \- Homelab Drive asynchronous task processor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B homelab-api-backend-processor
.RB [ --config
.IR path ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B homelab-api-backend-processor
is a standalone daemon that polls the
.I api.drive_files_tasks
queue and executes asynchronous Drive file work: thumbnail generation,
slideshow-image derivative generation, and copy/move file processing.
It connects to PostgreSQL
.B independently
of
.BR homelab-api (8)
\- it does not share a connection or process with it, and does not
require or use
.I dovecot.users
access.
.P
It is normally managed via the
.B homelab-api-backend-processor.service
systemd unit.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --config " path"
Path to the YAML configuration file. Default:
.IR /etc/homelab/processor/config.yml .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/homelab/processor/config.yml
Main configuration file (YAML). See CONFIGURATION below.
.SH CONFIGURATION
.SS database
PostgreSQL connection, configured independently of
.BR homelab-api (8) 's
own
.I database
section \- credentials are not shared or inherited even when both
services run on the same host.
.TP
.B host
Database host or IP (e.g. a pgbouncer endpoint). No default \- required.
.TP
.B port
Database port. Default:
.IR 5432 .
.TP
.B name
Database name. Default:
.IR mailserver .
.TP
.B user
Database role. Default:
.IR homelab_processor .
Should be a dedicated least-privilege role: CRUD on
.I api.*
only \- no
.I dovecot
schema access is needed or should be granted.
.TP
.B password
Database password for
.BR user .
No default \- required.
.SS processor
.TP
.B max_workers
Maximum number of file-processing tasks handled concurrently (one
worker per
.IR file_id ).
Default:
.IR 8 .
.TP
.B poll_interval_seconds
How often, in seconds, to poll for newly queued tasks. Default:
.IR 2 .
.TP
.B slide_show_image_size
Maximum dimensions for the slideshow-sized image derivative, as an
ImageMagick geometry string. Default:
.IR "1280x1280>" .
.TP
.B slide_show_image_quality
JPEG quality (0\-100) for the slideshow-sized image derivative.
Default:
.IR 82 .
.SS storage
.TP
.B drive_path
Filesystem path (typically an NFS mount) where Drive file content and
derivatives are stored. Must be set to the
.B identical
path used by
.BR homelab-api (8) 's
own
.I storage.drive_path
\- both services access the same mount independently.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR homelab-api (8)
.SH BUGS
Configuration, including database credentials, is read
.B only at startup.
After changing
.I /etc/homelab/processor/config.yml
(for example, rotating the database password), the service must be
restarted
.RI ( "systemctl restart homelab-api-backend-processor" )
\- it will not pick up the change while running, and a stale in-memory
password will silently stall the task queue rather than erroring
loudly.
